flowchart TD
    A[Tower kills enemy] --> B[TDHealthComponent::OnDeath]
    B --> C[AddGold to player]
    C --> D[Enemy->HandleDestroy]

    E[Enemy reaches spline end] --> F[ATDPlayerCharacter::LoseLife]
    F --> G{Lives <= 0?}
    G -->|Yes| H[LOSE]
    G -->|No| I[Enemy->HandleDestroy]

    D --> J[WaveSpawner::AddCountEnemyDeath]
    I --> J
    J --> K[Destroy actor]
